# MEDBOURSE Design

Follow `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` tokens and components.

- Use CSS variables from `apps/web/src/styles/tokens.css`; no arbitrary hex in components.
- Avoid generic AI-dashboard aesthetics (purple gradients, glassmorphism stacks, decorative blobs).
- Operational screens: tables, filters, clear status badges — not empty charts.
- Required states: loading, empty, error, success; keyboard focus visible.
- Arabic: `dir="rtl"` and logical properties; test layout per locale.
- No fake testimonials, partners, or live-looking placeholder metrics.
